  "translations": {
    "version": 1,
    "language": "zh",
    "source": "ai",
    "lines": [
      {
        "id": "line-1",
        "text": "我奔跑的路是 Love, Love, Love, Love",
        "source": "ai",
        "sourceHash": "b41bbdbee33f625069d091b4d2bc612e"
      },
      {
        "id": "line-2",
        "text": "但那条路上全是陷阱，陷阱，陷阱，陷阱",
        "source": "ai",
        "sourceHash": "7ec03bb821c65c1178b4c85a1151f804"
      },
      {
        "id": "line-3",
        "text": "无法避开的陷阱是心中的恐惧，恐惧，恐惧，恐惧",
        "source": "ai",
        "sourceHash": "7d1a7a61cc6116faffcfc796857b8305"
      },
      {
        "id": "line-4",
        "text": "像沼泽一样吞掉勇气，渐渐地..",
        "source": "ai",
        "sourceHash": "f29aa948478cc9c64dd415069807c1b4"
      },
      {
        "id": "line-5",
        "text": "我越来越渺小，脸上明朗的表情渐渐消失",
        "source": "ai",
        "sourceHash": "db0f4b5fecbee06bb4011ef35f0acdd0"
      },
      {
        "id": "line-6",
        "text": "总害怕你面对我的告白转过身去、避而不见",
        "source": "ai",
        "sourceHash": "cc04a895283599539727c3fd3f62832e"
      },
      {
        "id": "line-7",
        "text": "枕着针尖般的担忧，祈求迟迟不来的睡眠",
        "source": "ai",
        "sourceHash": "0c66c87ec6747863920e7ae99b5cd125"
      },
      {
        "id": "line-8",
        "text": "因为对你的思念比梦更清晰，最终熬了一整夜",
        "source": "ai",
        "sourceHash": "2408e1eab88a96eeb1b4df48d6a67672"
      },
      {
        "id": "line-9",
        "text": "Feels like insomnia, ah ah",
        "source": "ai",
        "sourceHash": "d103461384ae4f25174562ed2c526b3a"
      },
      {
        "id": "line-10",
        "text": "Feels like insomnia, ah ah",
        "source": "ai",
        "sourceHash": "d103461384ae4f25174562ed2c526b3a"
      },
      {
        "id": "line-11",
        "text": "Feels like insomnia, ah ah",
        "source": "ai",
        "sourceHash": "d103461384ae4f25174562ed2c526b3a"
      },
      {
        "id": "line-12",
        "text": "Feels like insomnia, ah ah",
        "source": "ai",
        "sourceHash": "d103461384ae4f25174562ed2c526b3a"
      },
      {
        "id": "line-13",
        "text": "朝着名为你的地方，即使孤独也要走的路",
        "source": "ai",
        "sourceHash": "84895ac47db34d02c2f7b30bf5af12ea"
      },
      {
        "id": "line-14",
        "text": "Love, Love, Love, Love",
        "source": "ai",
        "sourceHash": "12caf24838b850848427cb144150b2e0"
      },
      {
        "id": "line-15",
        "text": "无论跌倒几次，都会站起来走下去",
        "source": "ai",
        "sourceHash": "157ee9d34035914470bd4856e634bf47"
      },
      {
        "id": "line-16",
        "text": "But, But, But, But",
        "source": "ai",
        "sourceHash": "3842dcd6f06673dbeb266712ec1c6f6e"
      },
      {
        "id": "line-17",
        "text": "为了连觉都睡不着，一直看着你而染上的",
        "source": "ai",
        "sourceHash": "73b0d55d8a45542893f69c0d88f618c2"
      },
      {
        "id": "line-18",
        "text": "病，病，病，病",
        "source": "ai",
        "sourceHash": "bb043a74ef525026a027a5ff97bd8867"
      },
      {
        "id": "line-19",
        "text": "得不到你的爱，就永远治不好..",
        "source": "ai",
        "sourceHash": "179b7948aefdf9234a99b128bc4eb902"
      },
      {
        "id": "line-20",
        "text": "永远地、死一般地只等待你的允许",
        "source": "ai",
        "sourceHash": "6388306c70a828cac2c1a5630f46a6ae"
      },
      {
        "id": "line-21",
        "text": "无论几年、几辈子，我都会为你而存在",
        "source": "ai",
        "sourceHash": "3740826367e05cf0dccb602ff7e32e48"
      },
      {
        "id": "line-22",
        "text": "枕着针尖般的担忧，祈求迟迟不来的睡眠",
        "source": "ai",
        "sourceHash": "0c66c87ec6747863920e7ae99b5cd125"
      },
      {
        "id": "line-23",
        "text": "因为对你的思念比梦更清晰，最终熬了一整夜",
        "source": "ai",
        "sourceHash": "2408e1eab88a96eeb1b4df48d6a67672"
      },
      {
        "id": "line-24",
