      {
        "id": "line-27",
        "text": "Feels like insomnia, ah ah",
        "source": "ai",
        "sourceHash": "d103461384ae4f25174562ed2c526b3a"
      },
      {
        "id": "line-28",
        "text": "ah.. 这份燃烧的爱情..",
        "source": "ai",
        "sourceHash": "9cae08b945687ab36afe6bb8a5341b91"
      },
      {
        "id": "line-29",
        "text": "思念中疲惫落下",
        "source": "ai",
        "sourceHash": "84e900059b15b08b8a6edf6fe10d8b7d"
      },
      {
        "id": "line-30",
        "text": "纵使被雨一般的泪水浸湿 也不会冷却..",
        "source": "ai",
        "sourceHash": "324e4e531a73db15a5c9a4c179ca16bd"
      },
      {
        "id": "line-31",
        "text": "每天咬着嘴唇 祈求那不来的睡意",
        "source": "ai",
        "sourceHash": "4fff8d2cd256a34c6378376b60eb7bda"
      },
      {
        "id": "line-32",
        "text": "因为比梦更鲜活的你的念头 终究彻夜未眠",
        "source": "ai",
